    "race.fae.summary": "Elemental specialists, suited to Scoundrels and Mages.",
    "race.fae.blurb": "Every Fae belongs to one of four courts, chosen next. Your court gives you {courts:ember.startingAffinity.fire} affinity in its element, and its own weakness. +{races:fae.affinityCapBonus} affinity cap.",
    "race.fae.after": "Start with {courts:ember.startingAffinity.fire} affinity in your court's element. +{races:fae.affinityCapBonus} affinity cap. Takes 25% more damage from %weak.",
    "race.gloomling.summary": "Hardy Shadow specialists, suited to Mages and Clerics.",
    "race.gloomling.blurb": "Start with {races:gloomling.startingAffinity.shadow} Shadow affinity. +{races:gloomling.affinityCapBonus} affinity cap, {races:gloomling.passive.0.pct|abs}% less hunger. Take 25% more light damage.",
    "class.fighter.summary": "Tough melee fighters. Primary stat: Might.",
