    "god.murk.rule": "No Light: no Light affinity, enchantments, spells or sigils.",
    "god.murk.favors": "Favors Gloomlings, Shadow affinity and undead servants.",
    "god.murk.piety": "Kills of the living, extra for kills by your undead.",
